  "layout_note": "BOOK TRANSITION: S. Matthew has ended (p103) and this recto opens the front matter of S. MARKE — 'THE ARGVMENT OF S. MARKES GHOSPEL'. NO scripture body[]. Top: a row of fleuron printer's flowers; then the display title; then the Argument prose set with a floriated drop-cap 'M'. TWO glyph regimes interleave: an ITALIC vv-face for the four-part outline and the biographical summary, and a ROMAN real-w face for the extended S.Hierom/Eusebius discussion (with italic proper-names & citations embedded). Right margin carries four italic source citations. Catchword 'THE' at the foot. Modern watermark 'www.fatimamovement.com' + logo bottom-left excluded.",
